# Project Structure

- App Router: src/app/[locale]/
- Shipping homepage composition: src/app/[locale]/_components/SignalHeroPrototype.tsx
- Four-frame hero components: src/app/[locale]/_components/v2/{V2Hero,JourneyScenes}.tsx
- Real homepage scene styles: src/app/[locale]/_components/v2/scroll-journey.css and approved-four-frame.css
- Motion controller: public/flagship-journey/infinite-bc/motion.js (coordinate its cache key and CSS variables)
- Standalone public/flagship-journey/infinite-bc/index.html is historical proof, not the shipping React homepage.
- Read docs/development/BRANCHING_INTEGRATION_RELEASE.md for branch and QA policy.
- For multi-feature integration, branch from latest main, then branch dependent features from integration, not separately from main.
- Components: src/app/[locale]/start/components/
- Types: src/app/[locale]/start/lib/types.ts
- Presets: src/app/[locale]/start/lib/presets.ts
- Constants: src/constants/
- Max 200 lines per component file
- No new dependencies without explicit approval
